<ContentPage title="Privacy" eyebrow="Privacy" intro="This page explains, in plain terms, what happens when you use Start with your challenge. A complete privacy notice is still being finalised." noindex={true}>
<section class="content-section"><div class="shell content-grid"><div><h2>You can send TechSafeAI preliminary business context.</h2></div><div class="content-copy"><p><a href="/start-with-your-challenge">Start with your challenge</a> is the only online data-collection point on this website. It asks for preliminary business context — your organisation, industry, activity, timing and a named contact — intended for review by a person. It does not accept file uploads, and you are asked not to provide confidential, personal, medical, financial, credential or other protected information through it.</p><p>The form is built to support automated spam and bot checks, including Cloudflare Turnstile, where that is configured for a given deployment. Where the enquiry transport is configured, accepted submissions are recorded in TechSafeAI's customer relationship management system, HubSpot, so a person can follow up. This website does not use cookies, browser storage or analytics/tracking scripts.</p><p>A complete privacy notice — covering retention periods, legal basis, data-subject rights and any cross-border transfer — is still being finalised and will be published here. If you have a privacy question before then, raise it through <a href="/start-with-your-challenge">Start with your challenge</a> and a person will respond directly.</p></div></div></section>
</ContentPage>
